      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800516",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80051501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80051501": {
            "id": "80051501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Look, up there! A water pool!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051502"
            ]
          },
          "80051502": {
            "id": "80051502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Even the water pool is upside-down. Wow! This is a pretty amazing place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051503"
            ]
          },
          "80051503": {
            "id": "80051503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Dain, do you have any idea at all how it works?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051504"
            ]
          },
          "80051504": {
            "id": "80051504",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "The pool must be part of the entire city structure, a relic of this ancient civilization.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051505"
            ]
          },
          "80051505": {
            "id": "80051505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "And more importantly... it is the very thing that is weakening the curse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051506"
            ]
          },
          "80051506": {
            "id": "80051506",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Here, my whole body feels more at peace than it has in a long time. The effect is stronger here than it was before, and I think it's because that water pool has something akin to a cleansing effect.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051507"
            ]
          },
          "80051507": {
            "id": "80051507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Cleansing? So that means... the water in that pool can wash away the curse for good?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051508"
            ]
          },
          "80051508": {
            "id": "80051508",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "No. That would be impossible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051509"
            ]
          },
          "80051509": {
            "id": "80051509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How are you so sure?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051510"
            ]
          },
          "80051510": {
            "id": "80051510",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "I have lived with this curse for 500 years, and I have been fully conscious the entire time... Suffice to say, no one understands the curse like I do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051511"
            ]
          },
          "80051511": {
            "id": "80051511",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "It is a way of branding us at the level of the fate of the world itself. When a god applies a curse, it takes effect at a higher level of reality than the person themselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051512"
            ]
          },
          "80051512": {
            "id": "80051512",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Even now, I can feel the curse slowly permeating my entire being, becoming part of me, slowly but surely replacing me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051513"
            ]
          },
          "80051513": {
            "id": "80051513",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Perhaps it may be possible to suppress the corrosive effect of the curse for a time, but cleansing it entirely...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051514"
            ]
          },
          "80051514": {
            "id": "80051514",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Consider it tantamount to burning away an integral part of your body. It is not a process that one could ever hope to survive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051515"
            ]
          },
          "80051515": {
            "id": "80051515",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh!? Cleansing the curse costs you your life? Whoa... An irreversible curse, Paimon can't even imagine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051516"
            ]
          },
          "80051516": {
            "id": "80051516",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "In any case, I can feel that the water's cleansing effect is not nearly potent enough. At most, it might suppress the curse but a little.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051517"
            ]
          },
          "80051517": {
            "id": "80051517",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm? So what's that contraption there? It looks kinda out of place...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051520"
            ]
          },
          "80051520": {
            "id": "80051520",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Frankly, I have never seen a device of this design before either. It is not unreasonable to suspect that it could belong to the Abyss Order. But what could they be planning to do here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051521"
            ]
          },
          "80051521": {
            "id": "80051521",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "(*clunk* *clunk*...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051522"
            ]
          },
          "80051522": {
            "id": "80051522",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yikes! That gave Paimon a fright... So all the doors are open now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051523"
            ]
          },
          "80051523": {
            "id": "80051523",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Halfdan",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051524"
            ]
          },
          "80051524": {
            "id": "80051524",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wah, Halfdan's back again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051525"
            ]
          },
          "80051525": {
            "id": "80051525",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Halfdan. Do you have something to say to me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051526"
            ]
          },
          "80051526": {
            "id": "80051526",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Halfdan",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051527"
            ]
          },
          "80051527": {
            "id": "80051527",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He ran off... but he didn't disappear like last time!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80051528"
            ]
          },
          "80051528": {
            "id": "80051528",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "He's indicating that we should follow him. Are you coming?"
          }
        }
      }
